pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">&nbsp;다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">신청자격</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:돋움체;mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-size:12.0pt;\">공통사항</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:돋움체;font-family:돋움체;mso-ascii-font-family:돋움체;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-size:12.0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:18.2pt;text-indent:-18.2pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&nbsp; (</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">주 소 지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">공고일</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">(3. 17.) </span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">현재 본인이 구미시에 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체; letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"text-indent: -18.2pt; font-size: 12pt; font-family: 돋움체;\">년 이상 주민등록</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left:18.2pt;text-indent:-18.2pt;mso-pagination:none;text-autospace:none;mso-padding-alt:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: